{
 "schema": 1,
 "pinned_at": "2026-10-31",
 "game_subpath": "csgo",
 "note": "字节数是上游资源的实际大小，sha256 是这台机器装的那一份。install 会先比这两个值再落地；不一致就停下来问，不静默覆盖。",
 "exclude": [
  "README.md",
  "LICENSE",
  "LICENSE.txt",
  "README"
 ],
 "_exclude_note": "压缩包根目录里的说明文件不往游戏根目录倒",
 "preserve": [
  "addons/sourcemod/configs/core.cfg",
  "addons/sourcemod/configs/databases.cfg",
  "addons/sourcemod/configs/admins_simple.ini",
  "addons/sourcemod/plugins/botmimic.smx",
  "cfg/sourcemod/"
 ],
 "cvar_fixes": [
  {
   "file": "addons/sourcemod/configs/core.cfg",
   "key": "FollowCSGOServerGuidelines",
   "value": "no",
   "why": "出厂是 yes，皮肤/手套插件会因此拒绝非官方设置"
  }
 ],
 "hooks": [
  {
   "file": "cfg/listenserver.cfg",
   "append": [
    "// added by csgotool install (delete to revert)",
    "exec bots_improved.cfg"
   ],
   "marker": "exec bots_improved.cfg",
   "because": "listen 服启动时唯一的挂点；出厂这个文件是空的"
  },
  {
   "file": "cfg/gamemode_competitive_offline.cfg",
   "append": [
    "// added by csgotool install: must run last, otherwise the",
    "// two lines above re-add a 10th bot and the human is left in",
    "// spectator. delete to revert.",
    "exec bots_improved.cfg"
   ],
   "marker": "exec bots_improved.cfg",
   "because": "离线竞技的 bot_quota 10 会把真人挤成观察者"
  }
 ],
 "first_run": [
  "Steam 库里右键 csgo legacy → 属性 → 启动选项，写 -insecure。这一步脚本代不了：没有它引擎不加载 addons 里任何未签名 DLL",
  "开游戏，主菜单点 开始游戏 → 与电脑玩家，选一张 de_ 图。脚本确实能免掉这一跳（csgotool.py start --launch），但那样起来的局是引擎默认玩法而不是竞技局——game_type/game_mode 只是信息位的，已创建的局改不掉；要竞技局就得点这一下。csgotool.py mode 会告诉你现在到底是哪种玩法",
  "进图后换一次图（控制台 changelevel de_mirage，或退出重开一局）。Metamod 只在换图时装载，不换图 sm 命令全是 Unknown command",
  "回命令行跑：python tools\\csgotool.py mods —— 8 个 mod DLL 都该列出来",
  "再跑：python tools\\csgotool.py doctor —— 管道应答应有，插件版本应列出",
  "想让每局 bot 都是同一档强度：python tools\\csgotool.py bots patch --names（改的是你本机的 botprofile.db，带备份与还原）",
  "皮肤在游戏里用 !ws / !gloves / !knife 选（控制台直接敲 sm_ws 会以 client=0 运行，菜单不出现）"
 ],
